Subject: [PATCH] Add the expert pool, residency-aware routing and expert
 skipping

---
 common/corsia-experts.h | 308 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 common/corsia-pool.h    | 393 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 697 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
